[C9] PASS d zeta/d c_A = -(c_B + zeta)/(c_A + c_B + 2 zeta): exact (sympy)
[C10] PASS backward Euler on A <=> B contracts the distance to equilibrium by 1/(1 + dt (k_f + k_b)): exact (sympy); the factor lies in (0, 1] for every dt
